 hurt NVIDIA's financial results.\",\"Pursuing a particular transaction may limit NVIDIA's ability to enter into other transactions.\",\"Other transactions could help NVIDIA achieve other strategic objectives.\",\"If NVIDIA cannot complete acquisitions on time, including because of regulatory approval delays, NVIDIA may be unable to pursue other transactions.\",\"NVIDIA may not retain critical talent from an acquisition target.\",\"Technology may evolve and make an acquisition less attractive.\",\"Regulators could impose conditions that reduce the ultimate value of acquisitions.\",\"Investments in companies could create volatility and fluctuations in NVIDIA's results, including realized and unrealized gains or losses.\",\"NVIDIA could lose the full value of an investment.\",\"Many investee companies may not achieve profitability in the near term or at all.\",\"Investments in companies have no guaranteed return.\",\"NVIDIA's private-company investments include early-stage companies that are still defining strategic direction.\",\"Many securities held through private-company investments are non-marketable and illiquid at the time of initial investment.\",\"If private companies are unsuccessful, NVIDIA could recognize an impairment or lose all or part of an investment.\",\"NVIDIA's investment portfolio has industry sector concentration risks.\",\"A decline in an industry sector could increase impairment losses.\",\"Acquisitions or investments could divert capital and management attention.\",\"NVIDIA could have difficulty realizing a satisfactory return from acquisitions or investments.\",\"NVIDIA could have difficulty obtaining governmental or regulatory approvals or financing for a transaction.\",\"A deal could result in legal proceedings.\",\"Due diligence could fail to identify significant issues.\",\"Acquisitions could create difficulty integrating technology, systems, operations, and key personnel.\",\"Acquisitions could result in NVIDIA assuming liabilities.\",\"Acquisitions could result in amortization expenses, goodwill impairment charges, or write-downs of acquired assets.\",\"Acquisitions could create difficulty integrating accounting, forecasting, and controls.\",\"An acquisition could affect NVIDIA's stock price.\",\"An acquisition that cannot obtain regulatory approval or close could result in fines, fees, or harm to NVIDIA's reputation.\",\"Debt-financed acquisitions could increase NVIDIA's debt and interest expense and create covenant compliance risks.\",\"Acquisitions could involve dilutive equity issuances.\",\"Acquisitions could involve variability in performance-based consideration.\",\"Negative changes in economic conditions could create acquisition risks.\",\"Acquisitions could create additional cybersecurity risks.\",\"Acquisitions could impair NVIDIA's relationships with employees, vendors, and customers.\",\"NVIDIA says NVIDIA has experienced challenges integrating acquisition target systems.\",\"NVIDIA's acquisition system integration challenges have included lengthy and costly systems integration.\",\"NVIDIA's acquisition system integration challenges have caused delays in purchasing and shipping products.\",\"NVIDIA's acquisition system integration challenges have affected NVIDIA's results of operations and may continue to affect NVIDIA's results of operations.\",\"NVIDIA's filing says NVIDIA is finalizing an investment and partnership agreement with OpenAI.\",\"NVIDIA's filing gives no assurance that NVIDIA will enter into an investment and partnership agreement with OpenAI.\",\"NVIDIA's filing gives no assurance that an OpenAI transaction will be completed.\",\"The MD&A says NVIDIA invested $17.5 billion in private companies and infrastructure funds in fiscal year 2026.\",\"NVIDIA's fiscal year 2026 investments were primarily in early-stage startups, including AI model makers that purchase NVIDIA products.\",\"Many of NVIDIA's fiscal year 2026 investments are illiquid and non-marketable.\",\"NVIDIA provided $3.5 billion in land, power, and shell guarantees to early-stage companies.\",\"If escrow and partners' operating activities are insufficient to cover a default, NVIDIA may assume the underlying leases or sublease the underlying leases.\"]}", "type": "output_text", "logprobs": []}], "role": "assistant", "status": "completed", "type": "message", "phase": "final_answer"}], "parallel_tool_calls": true, "temperature": 1.0, "tool_choice": "auto", "tools": [], "top_p": 0.98, "background": false, "completed_at": 1792362440.0, "max_output_tokens": 10000, "max_tool_calls": null, "moderation": null, "previous_response_id": null, "prompt_cache_key": null, "prompt_cache_retention": "24h", "reasoning": {"context": "all_turns", "effort": "medium", "mode": "standard", "summary": null}, "safety_identifier": null, "service_tier": "default", "status": "completed", "text": {"format": {"name": "StatementGeneratorOutput", "schema": {"description": "Structured output for statement generation.", "properties": {"statements": {"description": "The generated statements from the answer", "items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Statements", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["statements"], "title": "StatementGeneratorOutput", "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false}, "type": "json_schema", "description": null, "strict": true}, "verbosity": "medium"}, "top_logprobs": 0, "truncation": "disabled", "usage": {"input_tokens": 1041, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 1038, "cached_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 1483, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 716}, "total_tokens": 2524}, "user": null, "access_programs": null, "billing": {"payer": "developer"}, "frequency_penalty": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 0.0, "store": false, "tool_usage": {"image_gen": {"input_tokens": 0, "input_tokens_details": {"image_tokens": 0, "text_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 0, "output_tokens_details": {"image_tokens": 0, "text_tokens": 0}, "total_tokens": 0}, "web_search": {"num_requests": 0}}}}